      "git.message": "feat: Add utility modules for AI processing, video handling, and database management\n\n- Implemented `ai_extras.py` for text censorship and viral score calculation using Groq.\n- Created `broll.py` for downloading relevant B-Roll videos based on keywords.\n- Developed `captioning.py` to generate SRT files from audio transcriptions.\n- Added `db.py` for PostgreSQL database interactions, including user and clip management.\n- Introduced `exa_search.py` for searching news articles using Exa Search SDK.\n- Created `groq_ai.py` for handling audio transcriptions and hook generation.\n- Added `hf.py` for future Hugging Face integrations.\n- Implemented `rss_google.py` for fetching and processing Google Trends and YouTube RSS feeds.\n- Developed `youtube.py` for downloading YouTube subtitles and audio segments.\n- Added `worker.py` for Celery task management to process video clips asynchronously.",
      "git.platform": "github",
      "git.remote_url": "https://github.com/adhitiad/clip-ai",
